  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "step": "01",
      "statement": "اكتب المجموع $A$ على الشكل $a\\sqrt{2}$ (مع $a$ عدد طبيعي) حيث: $A = \\sqrt{98} + \\sqrt{50} - \\sqrt{32}$ .",
      "learningPoints": [
        {
          "code": "4am_wadiya-idmajiya-judhur_P1",
          "role": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "cognitiveDemand": "apply",
      "answerType": "rational",
      "answerFormat": "اكتب العدد $a$ فقط (عدد طبيعي)",
      "expectedAnswer": "8",
      "misconceptionSignatures": [
        {
          "value": "4",
          "id": "MISC-JIDHR-JAMA"
        }
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "id": "h1",
          "type": "look",
          "content": "$98 = 49 \\times 2$ ، $50 = 25 \\times 2$ ، $32 = 16 \\times 2$ ."
        },
        {
          "id": "h2",
          "type": "direction",
          "content": "اكتب كل جذر على الشكل $k\\sqrt{2}$ ثم اجمع المعاملات."
        }
      ],
      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$A = 7\\sqrt{2} + 5\\sqrt{2} - 4\\sqrt{2} = 8\\sqrt{2}$",
        "incorrect": "لا تجمع الأعداد تحت الجذور: اكتب كل جذر على الشكل $k\\sqrt{2}$ أولًا."
      },
      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$A = \\sqrt{49 \\times 2} + \\sqrt{25 \\times 2} - \\sqrt{16 \\times 2}$",
          "$= 7\\sqrt{2} + 5\\sqrt{2} - 4\\sqrt{2}$",
          "$= (7 + 5 - 4)\\sqrt{2}$"
        ],
        "result": "A = 8\\sqrt{2}"
      },
      "work": "optional",
      "timeSeconds": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "step": "02",
      "statement": "احسب الجداء $A \\times \\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}$ مبينا مراحل الحساب.",
      "learningPoints": [
        {
          "code": "4am_wadiya-idmajiya-judhur_P1",
          "role": "primary"
        }
      ],
      "cognitiveDemand": "apply",
      "answerType": "rational",
